{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309050","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130905001:1":{"text":"당연하죠… 전 이런 곳에서 죽고 싶지 않아요. 저희는 상인이지 모험가가 아니잖아요?","source_cn":"肯定呀……我可不想把命搭在这地方，我们是商人，不是冒险家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD296BA5D16EFB4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130905002:1":{"text":"하지만 위험에는 기회도 동반되죠. 지금 크림슨 고원의 트라이브들이 한창 터전을 만드는 틈에 한탕 건져야겠어요!","source_cn":"不过，这事既是危险也是机遇。现在深红高原上的蛮血应该都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D7A15EC8945301E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130905003:1":{"text":"지금 이럴 게 아니라, 나도 빨리 물건을 들여와야겠어요. 다른 사람에게 기회를 빼앗길 순 없죠!","source_cn":"我得赶紧回去进点货，不能让别人抢了先！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8959C7F516248768","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:行商维娅帕里":{"text":"행상 베아파리","source":"行商维娅帕里","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}